      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Abstract 1 by Dr. Sterling feels far more authoritative because it employs complex statistical language and precise terminology that signals high-level expertise. In contrast, Abstract 2 by Dr. Adeyemi uses simple, colloquial phrasing like \"see how much\" and \"might make it harder,\" which lacks the rigorous tone expected in top-tier science. Therefore, Abstract 1 is clearly the superior choice for your high-impact section due to its sophisticated presentation and confident assertion of findings.",
